@MyWorkItemBackend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5162

### 1. 登入 (取得 Token)
# @name login
POST {{MyWorkItemBackend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 儲存 Token
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 2. 取得任務列表 (User)
GET {{MyWorkItemBackend_HostAddress}}/api/work-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 管理員建立任務 (Admin)
POST {{MyWorkItemBackend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/work-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "新任務測試",
  "description": "這是一個由 Admin 建立的測試任務"
}

### 4. 批次確認任務 (User)
# 請根據資料庫中的 ID 修改
POST {{MyWorkItemBackend_HostAddress}}/api/work-items/batch-confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workItemIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
}